# The Hollow Fang (CIPlay the_hollow_fang): the cleft at 3 m along x 0 from the sea cave (0 -50) to the hollow (0 8, r~12);
# trial 1 z -44..-27, the Word's pit z -26..-16 (stones x -1.6 0 1.6, rows -25.6..-14.4; letters O R I N on rows -24..-19.2), the Leap's
# chasm z -10..-4 with the invisible bridge at x 0; the glass bridge over the void to the altar (0 15.6); the window 0 28.
# 10-25 deep pass: the island is r 80 now, the cleft from the south shore at 0 -80. After the window: Orin's Knoll
# (-52 -18, 18 m; trail foot -52 -35) and his mast (the key), the boathouse at 40 62 (-10 m, the chest), Grey's cave 60 -30.
island The Hollow Fang
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Three Trials
expect hidden sandtrail
walk 0 -56 to 0 -51 h=3
zone sea_cave
expect step 1
read Kett's last diary page
expect step 2
zone trial1
expect step 3
expect spinsown blade1
walk 0 -43 to -2.6 -40 to 0 -36 to 0 -28 h=3
zone trial1_end
expect step 4
read The Word
expect step 5
zone wrong_stone
expect message throws you back
walk 0 -27 to 0 -25.6 to 0 -24 to 1.6 -22.4 to 0 -20.8 to -1.6 -19.2 to -1.6 -17.6 to 0 -14.4 to 0 -12.8 h=3
zone trial2_end
expect step 6
read The Leap
expect step 7
open Bag of sand
expect story sand 1
expect step 8
use lionhead
expect story sand 0
expect shown sandtrail
walk 0 -11 to 0 -7 to 0 -3 h=3
zone trial3_end
expect step 9
walk 0 -1 to 0 6 to 0 12.5 h=6.5
zone altar
kill Bear
expect step 10
open Altar
expect story gear3 1
expect step 11
read Orin's charge
expect step 12
zone fang_top
wait 7
expect step 13
zone knollfoot
expect step 14
zone knolltop
expect step 15
read Orin's journal
expect step 16
open Orin's lookout box
wait 3
expect story orinkey 1
expect step 17
zone boathouse
expect step 18
open Guardians' chest
wait 2
expect step 19
read Silas Grey's note
expect done
